{{define "notice"}}<aside class="notice" role="note">
<p><strong>A listing is not an endorsement.</strong> PantherClaw lists what publishers submit and vouches for nobody. Installing a publisher's bundle requires your org to pin that publisher's key first: an org admin pins it, then confirms it with a security key. Each install is checked against the pinned key and lands as drafts that your org reviews and signs.</p>
<p>This site takes no payment and installs nothing. Copy a command, check the digests and fingerprints yourself, and run it with <code>pclaw</code>.</p>
</aside>
{{end}}
{{define "foot"}}<footer><p>Static pages built by <code>task marketplace:build</code>. Digests are SHA-256 in lowercase hex.</p></footer>
